move over lacey chabert take a seat  danica mckellar it's okay  you two reigning sovereigns of christmas  movies can take a well-deserved break  because there is a new queen in town and  her name is vanessa hudgins  get out while some might still see  hudgens as the girl who danced and sang  her way into our hearts via high school  musical  our girl has been putting in the work in  order to cement herself as the new  matriarch of the christmas movie genre  and today we want to figure out just how  she holly  jollied her way onto the throne  like many stars who got their start in  the world of disney after her turn as  gabriella montez in the high school  musical movies was over  vanessa hudgins set out to prove to the  world that she could not only just sing  and dance  but she could really act as well she  took it upon herself to pick roles that  were the complete  opposite of her glossy disney persona in  films like the controversial spring  breakers  sucker punch and gimme shelter and while  she definitely succeeded in showing off  her full range of talents  there is no denying that vanessa hudgins  does sweet better than just about anyone  else  i love what i do and i get to do it all  the time  so when she appeared in the princess  switch in 2018  it was truly a christmas miracle and in  the years since  the vanessa hudgens christmas movies  have kept on coming  in the first hudgins plays a young baker  named stacy  who was entered into a baking  competition in the fictional country of  belgravia  there she has a chance encounter with  the princess of belgravia named margaret  who happens to look exactly like stacy  because they're both played by vanessa  hudgens stacy denovo i think we were  destined to run into each other  one year after the princess switch  premiered on netflix we were awarded  with another hudgens christmas classic  titled the night before christmas in  which she plays a young teacher who  falls in love with a time traveling  medieval night  and now finally in 2020 netflix released  the princess switch switched again  the sequel to the original princess  switch but this time we get not one  not two but three vanessa hudgins's  not only does hudgens reprise her roles  as stacy and princess margaret but this  time she dons a blonde wig  in order to play margaret's evil cousin  lady fiona  oh it's such a pain to find good help  these days and in case you're wondering  if the movies ever give some sort of  reason as to why all these three women  look completely identical  maybe because they were separated at  birth in some kind of parent trap  situation  well they don't these are just three  vaguely related  or not related at all women who just  happen to look exactly the same  while many actors and actresses who have  come before have made their fair share  of christmas movies  we can't think of any others who have  starred opposite two different versions  of themselves  it really is an iconic movie if you  think about it and for that reason we  have to recognize vanessa hudgens as the  queen of the christmas movie that she is  this should be interesting let's go  we're thrilled that while she definitely  still chooses interesting and  challenging projects during the time  when she isn't princess switching and  switching again hudgin seems to have  totally embraced her destiny as the  reigning queen of the holiday season  but what exactly makes the princess  switch such an instant classic holiday  movie  there are thousands and thousands of  these hallmark style films out there  and they do tend to follow a pretty  similar trajectory a young woman who is  either a baker  school teacher or a writer stylist for  fashion magazine  is looking to fall in love in all the  wrong places true love  is always a worthy wish she winds up  taking a trip back to her hometown  a trip to a foreign land or a literal  trip into the arms of an unexpected yet  exceedingly handsome stranger who will  eventually teach her the importance of  christmas  and perfectly groomed five o'clock  shadow and it's not like the princess  switch is the first christmas movie with  a royal theme either  the much beloved christmas prince series  is definitely the most famous example of  an ordinary woman who falls in love with  an  out of her league royal even if all of  his royal family members disapprove  and yet the princess switch and its  sequel really stand out among all of  them  whether that is because netflix has  simply perfected the christmas movie  formula  giving us all of the classic holiday  rom-com elements that we want  while adding in a layer of humor and  excitement by having a big star like  vanessa hudgens play multiple versions  of herself  the princess switch knows that it's  there to make us smile and laugh  and feel a little warmer during the cold  winter months and it delivers on all  fronts  but something we only just discovered  might just make the princess switch and  all of the other netflix christmas  movies  even more important than we thought they  are all connected  that's right it can now be proven that  nine of the best christmas movies on  netflix including the princess switch  all take place in the same universe it  goes back to 2018's the holiday calendar  in which a clip from the 2017 movie the  christmas inheritance can be seen  playing on tv  it also pops up once again on tv in the  first princess switch movie  in another little cameo netflix holiday  in the wild  can be seen playing on screen during the  second vanessa hudgens christmas movie  the night before christmas  but here's where things get really  interesting in the first princess switch  we see margaret and kevin watching the  beloved a christmas prince movie on tv  yet in switched again during margaret's  coronation scene amber and richard the  main characters in a christmas prince  are actually in attendance at the event  which can only mean one thing  in the world of the princess switch a  christmas prince is actually a  documentary about amber and richard  and we're not even done yet in 2018's  the night before christmas  vanessa hudgen's older sister tells her  daughter that her grandparents brought  back a giant decorative acorn from a  trip to aldovia  the fictional country in which a  christmas prince takes place  and then in a christmas prince the royal  baby  a map is shown which lists belgravia the  other fictional country where  the action of the princess switch is set  as a neighboring country to aldovia  phew is anyone else tired all of a  sudden if you need a visual for how all  of these films tie into one another  netflix themselves release this helpful  infographic so  not only do we know that the princess  switch and a christmas prince are taking  place just across a border from one  another  and that the royal families actually  know each other but that somehow the  night before christmas  is also in the same world even though  both belgravia and aldovia are fictional  and is set in the very real ohio what  does it all mean  we have to wonder just why netflix would  have gone through all of the trouble of  connecting these films to one another in  such obvious ways  they had to have known that fans would  spot the cameos and figure the whole  thing out  so what exactly are they planning it  makes sense that belgravia and aldovia  could exist in the same world  but why did they sneak in that reference  to aldovia in the night before christmas  we don't concern ourselves with the  details we have people for that  of course of course while we don't know  for sure  we have one theory brooke and her time  traveling knight  are eventually going to make their way  into the princess switch  we already have three vanessa hudgens's  it's not out of the realm of possibility  that we could soon have a fourth  and hey they have already introduced  time travel so would a plane ride to  belgravia really be all that difficult  modern technology is lit  a f and who's to say they'll stop there  we have a feeling that netflix is just  getting started with the expansion of  their christmas movie cinematic universe  following in the footsteps of marvel and  the avengers we can picture a future in  which all of the characters from the  night before christmas  the princess switch and a christmas  prince all come together in one  massive avengers endgame style spectacle  only there will be less war  and a lot more mistaken identity hijinks  and happy endings  we hope and if all of that winds up  happening it will mean a million more  opportunities for vanessa hudgins to  take on as  many different characters as she  possibly can we know netflix has the  budget for all of the wigs needed to  make  it work we absolutely hope that one day  in the future  we are gifted a movie called the  princess switch the switching  in which vanessa hudgins plays every  single character including the four that  she already has created  and maybe one day they'll try to explain  just why all of these women have the  exact same face  we cannot wait to see how netflix  continues to tie these three films  together  over the holidays for years to come and  we have no doubt that the reigning queen  of christmas miss vanessa hudgins will  be at the center of it all  now that we have established that  vanessa hudgins is without a doubt the  absolute queen of the christmas season  we can only hope that her reign is long  and prosperous  what about you do you love the netflix  christmas universe as much as we do  or do you think that a different star  should sit on the throne let us know in  the comments  and don't forget to hit that subscribe  button to keep up with all the latest  videos from the things
 

